将图中从左到右的线段3,3,4,5视为向量a,b,c,d，记要求的向量为s，则有关系式
$
  (arrow(s))^2 & = (arrow(a) + arrow(b) + arrow(c) + arrow(d) )^2 \
             0 & = arrow(a) dot (arrow(a) + arrow(b) + arrow(c) + arrow(d)) \
             0 & = arrow(b) dot arrow(c) = arrow(c) dot arrow(d)
$

代入有
$
  (arrow(s))^2 & = (arrow(a) + arrow(b) + arrow(c) + arrow(d))^2 \
  & = arrow(a)^2 + arrow(b)^2 + arrow(c)^2 + arrow(d)^2 +2 arrow(a) dot arrow(b) +2 arrow(a) dot arrow(c) +2 arrow(a) dot arrow(d) + 2 arrow(b) dot arrow(c) + 2 arrow(b) dot arrow(d)+2 arrow(c) dot arrow(d) \
  & = 2(arrow(a)^2 + arrow(a) dot arrow(b) +2 arrow(a) dot arrow(c) +2 arrow(a) dot arrow(d)) - arrow(a)^2 + arrow(b)^2 + arrow(c)^2 + arrow(d)^2 + 2 arrow(b) dot arrow(d)\
  & =0 - 9 + 9 + 16 + 25 + 2 dot 15\
  & = 71
$
所以$s=sqrt(71).$
